<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32388" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλογ-ίζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>compute, reckon,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς εὐθύνας</span> Harp.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογισταί; τὸ ἀργύριον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				9(1).694.104
			</span></i> (Corc.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				22.1263.12
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριθμὸν..ἐκ τῶν
				ἀντιγράφων-λογισθέντα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.3073.56
			</span></i> (Lebad.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>consider, reflect on,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.1
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				1409
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.40
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.57
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πρὸς οἵους..ὁ ἀγὼν ἔσται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.70
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὅτι..</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.123
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίς ὢν πρὸς οὕστινας ἐπολέμει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.64
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλογισθῆναι</span> in pass. sense,
				<i>to be calculated,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Publ.</u>
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>reckon on,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδεὶς ἔθ᾽ αὑτοῦ θάνατον
					ἐκλογίζεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					482
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>reckon up, relate in detail,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.99.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.9.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				11.40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>=
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλογέομαι, τινὶ περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					3.43
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
